Prior work
----------
This repository grew out of photo-to-threejs:
https://github.com/alekseikondratenko/photo-to-threejs

That project acknowledged img2threejs (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs
Its early process harness and documentation discipline informed development.
This historical attribution is retained; it is not an installation dependency.

Third-party dependencies
------------------------
Bundled JavaScript incorporates dependencies under their respective licenses,
including three.js, @modelcontextprotocol/sdk, @modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps,
Zod, pngjs, jpeg-js, Express and cors (MIT). Vite is a development dependency
(MIT). Dependency identities and exact versions are recorded in
mcp/package-lock.json; bundled license comments are retained in mcp/dist/.

Blender, Bonsai/IfcOpenShell and Blender MCP are installed separately and are
not redistributed as add-ons by this plugin.

